              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.17.7+REV.17.8+REV.17.9+REV.17.10+REV.17.11+REV.17.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "7-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nadol nanu eng'ues eilepu aing'uaa atua enaiposha naata imowuarak tomon, o lukuny naapishana neishopokino nkishiliaa tomon e nkitoo nena mowuarak enyena. Netii enkarna e morore nena lukuny enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.4+DAN.7.5+DAN.7.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 7.4-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore ina ng'ues natoduaa neikununo ana olowuaru keri. Netiu nkejek enyena anaa ino lng'arurumi, netiu enkutuk enye ana eno lng'atuny. Neisho ilo asurai ina ng'ues engolon enye o lorika lenye le nkitoo, o enkidimata sapuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nabo oo lukuny enyena, eijo keeta olbae le nkeeya. Ore ilo bae lenye le keeya neishiwuo, nesuj enkop pooki ina ng'ues eing'asia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neserem iltung'ana ilo asurai, amu eishoo ninye enkidimata enye ina ng'ues neserem, ninche ina ng'ues ejo “Ae ng'ae otiu anaa ina ng'ues, naa ae ng'ae oidima airisha?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
